&lt;div&gt;Rearrange the parts of the sentence in the correct order.&lt;br /&gt;
Inflation&lt;br /&gt;
P. making it difficult for households&lt;br /&gt;
Q. to manage daily expenses&lt;br /&gt;
R. affects purchasing power&lt;br /&gt;
S. and leads to increased cost of living,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt; [Steno, 06 Aug 2025, Shift 1]

solution.en:
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=""&gt;The correct answer is &lt;strong&gt;Option 4&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div&gt; &lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=""&gt;&lt;span style="display: flex;gap: 6px;align-items: center;"&gt;&lt;img height="26px" src="https://cdn.testbook.com/resources/lms_creative_elements/key-point-image.png" width="26px"  style="width: 28px !important; height: 28px !important; display: inline-block !important; vertical-align: middle !important; margin: 0 8px 0 0 !important;" /&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style="vertical-align: middle;font-size: 21px;"&gt;&lt;u&gt;Key Points&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
        &lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=""&gt;The sentence talks about the impact of inflation and needs to be arranged logically.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
        &lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=""&gt;The correct sequence is &lt;strong&gt;RSPQ&lt;/strong&gt;, as it starts with describing the main effect of inflation (&lt;em&gt;affects purchasing power&lt;/em&gt;).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
        &lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=""&gt;The next part (&lt;em&gt;leads to increased cost of living&lt;/em&gt;) elaborates the consequence.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
        &lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=""&gt;Finally, the last two parts (&lt;em&gt;making it difficult for households&lt;/em&gt; and &lt;em&gt;to manage daily expenses&lt;/em&gt;) complete the thought by explaining the specific challenges.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=""&gt;Therefore, the correct order is &lt;strong&gt;RSPQ&lt;/strong&gt;, and the correct answer is &lt;strong&gt;Option 4&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div&gt; &lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=""&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Correct Sentence:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;em&gt;"Inflation affects purchasing power, and leads to increased cost of living, making it difficult for households to manage daily expenses."&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div&gt; &lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=""&gt;&lt;span style="display: flex;gap: 6px;align-items: center;"&gt;&lt;img height="26px" src="https://cdn.testbook.com/resources/lms_creative_elements/additional-information-image.png" width="26px"  style="width: 28px !important; height: 28px !important; display: inline-block !important; vertical-align: middle !important; margin: 0 8px 0 0 !important;" /&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style="vertical-align: middle;font-size: 21px;"&gt;&lt;u&gt;Additional Information&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
        &lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=""&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Option 1 (QSPR):&lt;/strong&gt; This sequence does not establish the logical flow of the sentence.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
        &lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=""&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Option 2 (SRQP):&lt;/strong&gt; This arrangement begins with the consequence but leaves out the cause and logical structure.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
        &lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=""&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Option 3 (PORS):&lt;/strong&gt; This option is incorrect as it does not align the sentence in a coherent manner.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
        &lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=""&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Option 5:&lt;/strong&gt; This option is not relevant as the correct answer is Option 4.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

