	&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=""&gt;The part &lt;strong&gt;&amp;quot;R. the young shooter&amp;quot;&lt;/strong&gt; serves as the subject of the sentence, so it should come first.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=""&gt;The part &lt;strong&gt;&amp;quot;Q. was selected for the Olympic squad&amp;quot;&lt;/strong&gt; logically follows as the verb and object, forming the action.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=""&gt;The part &lt;strong&gt;&amp;quot;S. due to his exceptional performance at the national trials&amp;quot;&lt;/strong&gt; explains the reason for the selection, so it comes next.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=""&gt;Finally, the part &lt;strong&gt;&amp;quot;P. though he lacked international experience&amp;quot;&lt;/strong&gt; provides a contrasting detail, which fits at the end.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=""&gt;Therefore, the correct sequence is &lt;strong&gt;R-Q-S-P&lt;/strong&gt;, and the correct answer is &lt;strong&gt;Option 3&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=""&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Correct Sentence:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;em&gt;&amp;quot;The young shooter was selected for the Olympic squad due to his exceptional performance at the national trials, though he lacked international experience.&amp;quot;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

