solution.en:
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=""&gt;The correct answer is &lt;strong&gt;Option (3)&lt;/strong&gt; i.e. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgb(33, 37, 41);"&gt;BCAD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style="display: flex;gap: 6px;align-items: center;"&gt;&lt;img height="26px" src="https://cdn.testbook.com/resources/lms_creative_elements/key-point-image.png" width="26px"  style="width: 28px !important; height: 28px !important; display: inline-block !important; vertical-align: middle !important; margin: 0 8px 0 0 !important;" /&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style="vertical-align: middle;font-size: 21px;"&gt;&lt;u&gt;Key Points&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=""&gt;The sentence begins with the subject &amp;quot;&lt;strong&gt;Wildlife sanctuaries&lt;/strong&gt;,&amp;quot; which is correctly indicated by &lt;strong&gt;part (B).&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=""&gt;Following the subject, &amp;quot;&lt;strong&gt;have been established&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;quot; &lt;strong&gt;(BC)&lt;/strong&gt; continues the logical sequence, explaining the action related to wildlife sanctuaries.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=""&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The next part,&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;&lt;strong&gt;to protect endangered species&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;quot; (A), explains the purpose of establishing the sanctuaries.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=""&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ending with &lt;/strong&gt;&amp;quot;&lt;strong&gt;across the country&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;quot; (D) completes the sentence by specifying the scope of the action.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=""&gt;Therefore, the correct answer is &lt;strong&gt;BCAD.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style="display: flex;gap: 6px;align-items: center;"&gt;&lt;img height="26px" src="https://cdn.testbook.com/resources/lms_creative_elements/additional-information-image.png" width="26px"  style="width: 28px !important; height: 28px !important; display: inline-block !important; vertical-align: middle !important; margin: 0 8px 0 0 !important;" /&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style="vertical-align: middle;font-size: 21px;"&gt;&lt;u&gt;Additional Information&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=""&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Option 1 (BADC):&lt;/strong&gt; This option starts with &amp;quot;&lt;strong&gt;Wildlife sanctuaries to protect endangered species have been established across the country&lt;/strong&gt;,&amp;quot; which creates a grammatically incorrect and illogical sentence structure.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=""&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Option 2&amp;nbsp;(&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgb(33, 37, 41);"&gt;BACD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=""&gt;&lt;strong&gt;):&lt;/strong&gt; This option starts with &amp;quot;&lt;strong&gt;Wildlife sanctuaries&amp;nbsp;to protect endangered species &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: bolder;"&gt;have been established&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=""&gt;&lt;strong&gt;across the country&lt;/strong&gt;,&amp;quot; but the parts are not in the most logical order.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=""&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Option 4 (CBAD):&lt;/strong&gt; This option begins with &amp;quot;&lt;strong&gt;have been established wildlife sanctuaries across the country to protect endangered species&lt;/strong&gt;,&amp;quot; which does not provide a coherent sentence.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

question.en:
