solution.en:
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=""&gt;The correct answer is &lt;strong&gt;Option (1)&lt;/strong&gt; i.e. &lt;strong&gt;BACD&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style="display: flex; gap: 6px; align-items: center;"&gt;&lt;img height="26px" src="https://cdn.testbook.com/resources/lms_creative_elements/key-point-image.png" width="26px"  style="width: 28px !important; height: 28px !important; display: inline-block !important; vertical-align: middle !important; margin: 0 8px 0 0 !important;" /&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style="vertical-align: middle; font-size: 21px;"&gt;&lt;u&gt;Key Points&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=""&gt;The sentence begins with the subject &amp;quot;we,&amp;quot; which is correctly indicated by &lt;strong&gt;part (B).&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=""&gt;Following the subject, the verb &amp;quot;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgb(33, 37, 41);"&gt;every week&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=""&gt;&amp;quot; &lt;strong&gt;(BA)&lt;/strong&gt; continues the logical sequence by&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgb(33, 37, 41);"&gt;adding the time frame.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=""&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The next part,&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgb(33, 37, 41);"&gt;play&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=""&gt;&amp;quot; (BAC), &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgb(33, 37, 41);"&gt;making it clear what action is being performed.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=""&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ending with &lt;/strong&gt;&amp;quot;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgb(33, 37, 41);"&gt;cricket&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=""&gt;&amp;quot; (BACD) completes the sentence by&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgb(33, 37, 41);"&gt;adding&amp;nbsp;the object to the sentence, clarifying what is being played.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=""&gt;Therefore, the correct answer is &lt;strong&gt;BACD.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style="display: flex; gap: 6px; align-items: center;"&gt;&lt;img height="26px" src="https://cdn.testbook.com/resources/lms_creative_elements/additional-information-image.png" width="26px"  style="width: 28px !important; height: 28px !important; display: inline-block !important; vertical-align: middle !important; margin: 0 8px 0 0 !important;" /&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style="vertical-align: middle; font-size: 21px;"&gt;&lt;u&gt;Additional Information&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=""&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Option 2 (BADC):&lt;/strong&gt; This option starts with &amp;quot;we play every week cricket,&amp;quot; which does not follow correct grammatical structure.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=""&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Option 3 (DACB):&lt;/strong&gt; This option starts with &amp;quot;cricket every week we play,&amp;quot; which disrupts the natural flow of the sentence.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=""&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Option 4 (CADB):&lt;/strong&gt; This option starts with &amp;quot;play cricket we every week,&amp;quot; which creates a confusing and fragmented sentence structure.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=""&gt;Note:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;This is a PYP question, and the official answer key has marked (correct option) as the correct answer, hence we cannot make any changes to it.&lt;/p&gt;

question.en:
