&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style="display: flex;gap: 6px;align-items: center;"&gt;&lt;img height="26px" src="https://cdn.testbook.com/resources/lms_creative_elements/key-point-image.png" width="26px"  style="width: 28px !important; height: 28px !important; display: inline-block !important; vertical-align: middle !important; margin: 0 8px 0 0 !important;" /&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style="vertical-align: middle;font-size: 21px;"&gt;&lt;u&gt;Key Points&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=""&gt;The sentence begins with the subject &amp;quot;The villagers,&amp;quot; which is correctly indicated by &lt;strong&gt;part (B).&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=""&gt;Following the subject, &amp;quot;repaired the damaged bridge&amp;quot; &lt;strong&gt;(BC)&lt;/strong&gt; continues the logical sequence, making it clear what the villagers did.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=""&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The next part,&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgb(33, 37, 41);"&gt;before the heavy rains&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=""&gt;,&amp;quot; adds information by&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgb(33, 37, 41);"&gt;providing the context of time, indicated by &lt;strong&gt;(A).&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=""&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ending with&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgb(33, 37, 41);"&gt;with the help of officials&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=""&gt;&amp;quot;&lt;strong&gt; (D) &lt;/strong&gt;completes the sentence by showing&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgb(33, 37, 41);"&gt;&amp;nbsp;how the action was completed&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=""&gt;Therefore, the correct answer is &lt;strong&gt;BCAD.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style="display: flex;gap: 6px;align-items: center;"&gt;&lt;img height="26px" src="https://cdn.testbook.com/resources/lms_creative_elements/additional-information-image.png" width="26px"  style="width: 28px !important; height: 28px !important; display: inline-block !important; vertical-align: middle !important; margin: 0 8px 0 0 !important;" /&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style="vertical-align: middle;font-size: 21px;"&gt;&lt;u&gt;Additional Information&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=""&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Option 1 (DACB):&lt;/strong&gt; This option starts with &amp;quot;with the help of officials the villagers before the heavy rains repaired the damaged bridge,&amp;quot; which creates a confusing and grammatically incorrect sequence.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=""&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Option 2 (BACD):&lt;/strong&gt; This option starts with &amp;quot;the villagers with the help of officials before the heavy rains repaired the damaged bridge,&amp;quot; which disrupts the logical flow of the sentence.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=""&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Option 4 (ABCD):&lt;/strong&gt; This option starts with &amp;quot;before the heavy rains the villagers with the help of officials repaired the damaged bridge,&amp;quot; which makes the sentence awkward and unclear.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

