	&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=""&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Option 2 (BCAD):&lt;/strong&gt; This option places &amp;quot;and rich&amp;quot; after &amp;quot;cultural history,&amp;quot; making the sentence grammatically incorrect.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=""&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Option 4 (BADC):&lt;/strong&gt; This option places &amp;quot;has a long&amp;quot; after &amp;quot;and rich,&amp;quot; which makes the structure awkward and illogical.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

