	&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=""&gt;Following the subject,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgb(33, 37, 41);"&gt;&amp;quot;read,&amp;quot; which is correctly indicated by&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: bolder;"&gt;part (A).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
