	&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=""&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ending with &lt;/strong&gt;completes the sentence by &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgb(33, 37, 41);"&gt;&amp;quot;carefully&amp;quot; (D), specifies how the instructions should be read.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=""&gt;Therefore, the correct answer is &lt;strong&gt;BACD.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

