	&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=""&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Option 3 (BCAD):&lt;/strong&gt; This option starts with &amp;quot;the instructions carefully,&amp;quot; which is incomplete and grammatically incorrect without the subject.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=""&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Option 4 (BDCA):&lt;/strong&gt; This sequence creates a confusing structure and does not follow proper grammatical order.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=""&gt;Note:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;This is a PYP question, and the official answer key has marked (correct option) as the correct answer, hence we cannot make any changes to it.&lt;/p&gt;

