solution.en:
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=""&gt;The correct answer is &lt;strong&gt;Option (1)&lt;/strong&gt; i.e. &lt;strong&gt;ABCD&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style="display: flex; gap: 6px; align-items: center;"&gt;&lt;img height="26px" src="https://cdn.testbook.com/resources/lms_creative_elements/key-point-image.png" width="26px"  style="width: 28px !important; height: 28px !important; display: inline-block !important; vertical-align: middle !important; margin: 0 8px 0 0 !important;" /&gt; &lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style="vertical-align: middle; font-size: 21px;"&gt;&lt;u&gt;Key Points&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=""&gt;The sentence begins with the subject &amp;quot;&lt;strong&gt;my mother&lt;/strong&gt;,&amp;quot; which is correctly indicated by &lt;strong&gt;part (A).&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=""&gt;Following the subject, &amp;quot;&lt;strong&gt;bought&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;quot; &lt;strong&gt;(AB)&lt;/strong&gt; continues the logical sequence, making it clear what the mother did.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=""&gt;The next part, &amp;quot;&lt;strong&gt;a beautiful saree&lt;/strong&gt;,&amp;quot; completes the object of the action, indicated by &lt;strong&gt;(C).&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=""&gt;The sentence ends with &amp;quot;&lt;strong&gt;yesterday&lt;/strong&gt;,&amp;quot; which provides the time of the action, indicated by &lt;strong&gt;(D).&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=""&gt;Therefore, the correct answer is &lt;strong&gt;ABCD.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;

