question.en:
&lt;div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Rearrange the parts of the sentence in the correct order.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Postcolonial literature&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;P. interrogates historical narratives,&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Q. While reclaiming suppressed voices&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;R. and offers alternative perspectives&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;S. rooted in indigenous experience,&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt; [Steno, 08 Aug 2025, Shift 1]

solution.en:
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=""&gt;The correct answer is &lt;strong&gt;Option (1)&lt;/strong&gt; i.e. &lt;strong&gt;PSRQ&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style="display: flex;gap: 6px;align-items: center;"&gt;&lt;img height="26px" src="https://cdn.testbook.com/resources/lms_creative_elements/key-point-image.png" width="26px"  style="width: 28px !important; height: 28px !important; display: inline-block !important; vertical-align: middle !important; margin: 0 8px 0 0 !important;" /&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style="vertical-align: middle;font-size: 21px;"&gt;&lt;u&gt;Key Points&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=""&gt;The sentence begins with part &lt;strong&gt;P&lt;/strong&gt;, &amp;quot;interrogates historical narratives,&amp;quot; as it introduces the main theme of postcolonial literature.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=""&gt;Part &lt;strong&gt;S&lt;/strong&gt;, &amp;quot;rooted in indigenous experience,&amp;quot; comes next, providing context about the foundation of the historical narratives.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=""&gt;Part &lt;strong&gt;R&lt;/strong&gt;, &amp;quot;and offers alternative perspectives,&amp;quot; logically continues the sentence by explaining the purpose of interrogating narratives.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=""&gt;Finally, part &lt;strong&gt;Q&lt;/strong&gt;, &amp;quot;while reclaiming suppressed voices,&amp;quot; concludes the sentence, emphasizing the ultimate goal of postcolonial literature.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=""&gt;Therefore, the correct arrangement is &lt;strong&gt;PSRQ.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style="display: flex;gap: 6px;align-items: center;"&gt;&lt;img height="26px" src="https://cdn.testbook.com/resources/lms_creative_elements/additional-information-image.png" width="26px"  style="width: 28px !important; height: 28px !important; display: inline-block !important; vertical-align: middle !important; margin: 0 8px 0 0 !important;" /&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style="vertical-align: middle;font-size: 21px;"&gt;&lt;u&gt;Additional Information&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=""&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Option 2 (RSPQ):&lt;/strong&gt; This arrangement disrupts the logical sequence by starting with alternative perspectives without first introducing the historical narratives being interrogated.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=""&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Option 3 (QRSP):&lt;/strong&gt; Starting with &amp;quot;while reclaiming suppressed voices&amp;quot; makes the sentence lose its focus on interrogating historical narratives, which is central to postcolonial literature.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=""&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Option 4 (SRPQ):&lt;/strong&gt; This arrangement creates a fragmented and unclear sentence structure by starting with indigenous experience without providing context.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

