question.en:
&lt;div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Rearrange the parts of this sentence:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;(A) several measures&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;(B) have been introduced&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;(C) by the government&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;(D) to control inflation&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt; [Steno, 08 Aug 2025, Shift 2]

solution.en:
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=""&gt;The correct answer is &lt;strong&gt;Option 2&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=""&gt;&lt;span style="display: flex;gap: 6px;align-items: center;"&gt;&lt;img height="26px" src="https://cdn.testbook.com/resources/lms_creative_elements/key-point-image.png" width="26px"  style="width: 28px !important; height: 28px !important; display: inline-block !important; vertical-align: middle !important; margin: 0 8px 0 0 !important;" /&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style="vertical-align: middle;font-size: 21px;"&gt;&lt;u&gt;Key Points&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=""&gt;We need a grammatically correct and meaningful sentence.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=""&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sentence A starts&lt;/strong&gt; the sentence with the subject:&lt;/span&gt;
	&lt;ul&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=""&gt;&amp;quot;Several measures&amp;quot;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;/ul&gt;
	&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=""&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sentence C follows&lt;/strong&gt; to specify who introduced them:&lt;/span&gt;
	&lt;ul&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=""&gt;&amp;quot;by the government&amp;quot;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;/ul&gt;
	&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=""&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sentence B comes next&lt;/strong&gt; as the verb phrase:&lt;/span&gt;
	&lt;ul&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=""&gt;&amp;quot;have been introduced&amp;quot;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;/ul&gt;
	&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=""&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sentence D completes&lt;/strong&gt; the purpose:&lt;/span&gt;
	&lt;ul&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=""&gt;&amp;quot;to control inflation&amp;quot;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;/ul&gt;
	&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=""&gt;Thus, the correct sequence is &lt;strong&gt;ACBD&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=""&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Coherent sentence after rearrangement&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=""&gt;&amp;quot;Several measures by the government have been introduced to control inflation.&amp;quot;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=""&gt;The correct answer is &lt;strong&gt;Option 4&lt;/strong&gt; i.e. &lt;strong&gt;DABC&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style="display: flex;gap: 6px;align-items: center;"&gt;&lt;img height="26px" src="https://cdn.testbook.com/resources/lms_creative_elements/key-point-image.png" width="26px"  style="width: 28px !important; height: 28px !important; display: inline-block !important; vertical-align: middle !important; margin: 0 8px 0 0 !important;" /&gt; &lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style="vertical-align: middle;font-size: 21px;"&gt;&lt;u&gt;Key Points&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=""&gt;The sentence begins with the subject &lt;strong&gt;&amp;quot;we&amp;quot;&lt;/strong&gt; (D), indicating who is performing the action.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=""&gt;Next, the verb phrase &lt;strong&gt;&amp;quot;water the plants&amp;quot;&lt;/strong&gt; (A) follows the subject, describing the action.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=""&gt;The adverbial phrase &lt;strong&gt;&amp;quot;every morning&amp;quot;&lt;/strong&gt; (B) specifies the frequency of the action and logically comes after the verb.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=""&gt;Finally, &lt;strong&gt;&amp;quot;before breakfast&amp;quot;&lt;/strong&gt; (C) indicates the time, completing the sentence with a clear temporal context.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=""&gt;Therefore, the correct sequence of sentence parts is &lt;strong&gt;DABC&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style="display: flex;gap: 6px;align-items: center;"&gt;&lt;img height="26px" src="https://cdn.testbook.com/resources/lms_creative_elements/additional-information-image.png" width="26px"  style="width: 28px !important; height: 28px !important; display: inline-block !important; vertical-align: middle !important; margin: 0 8px 0 0 !important;" /&gt; &lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style="vertical-align: middle;font-size: 21px;"&gt;&lt;u&gt;Additional Information&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

