(B) stricter traffic rules&lt;br /&gt;
(C) should be implemented&lt;br /&gt;
(D) immediately&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt; [Steno, 08 Aug 2025, Shift 3]

solution.en:
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=""&gt;The correct answer is &lt;strong&gt;Option (1)&lt;/strong&gt; i.e. &lt;b&gt;BCAD.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style="display: flex;gap: 6px;align-items: center;"&gt;&lt;img height="26px" src="https://cdn.testbook.com/resources/lms_creative_elements/key-point-image.png" width="26px"  style="width: 28px !important; height: 28px !important; display: inline-block !important; vertical-align: middle !important; margin: 0 8px 0 0 !important;" /&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style="vertical-align: middle;font-size: 21px;"&gt;&lt;u&gt;Key Points&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=""&gt;The sentence begins with the subject &amp;quot;Stricter traffic rules,&amp;quot; which is correctly indicated by &lt;strong&gt;part (B).&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=""&gt;Following the subject, &amp;quot;should be implemented&amp;quot; &lt;strong&gt;(BC)&lt;/strong&gt; continues the logical sequence, stating what needs to be done.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=""&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The next part,&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;to improve road safety,&amp;quot; adds the purpose of implementing stricter traffic rules, indicated by (A).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=""&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ending with &lt;/strong&gt;&amp;quot;immediately&amp;quot; (D) completes the sentence by emphasizing the urgency of the implementation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=""&gt;Therefore, the correct answer is &lt;strong&gt;ABCD.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style="display: flex;gap: 6px;align-items: center;"&gt;&lt;img height="26px" src="https://cdn.testbook.com/resources/lms_creative_elements/additional-information-image.png" width="26px"  style="width: 28px !important; height: 28px !important; display: inline-block !important; vertical-align: middle !important; margin: 0 8px 0 0 !important;" /&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style="vertical-align: middle;font-size: 21px;"&gt;&lt;u&gt;Additional Information&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=""&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Option 2 (CBAD):&lt;/strong&gt; This option starts with &amp;quot;should be implemented stricter traffic rules,&amp;quot; which is grammatically incorrect and disrupts the logical flow.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=""&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Option 3 (BACD):&lt;/strong&gt; This option starts with &amp;quot;Stricter traffic rules to improve road safety should be implemented,&amp;quot; which misplaces the urgency emphasized by &amp;quot;immediately.&amp;quot;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: bolder;"&gt;Option 4&amp;nbsp;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: bolder;"&gt;ABCD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: bolder;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: bolder;"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;This option starts with &amp;quot;to improve road safety&amp;quot; but ends with &amp;quot;immediately&amp;quot; in the wrong order.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=""&gt;The correct answer is &lt;strong&gt;Option (4)&lt;/strong&gt; i.e. &lt;strong&gt;ABCD&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

