	&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=""&gt;The sentence follows a logical and grammatically correct sequence:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=""&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Part (A):&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;I have never&amp;quot; begins the sentence, introducing the subject.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=""&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Part (B):&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;seen such&amp;quot; connects smoothly, describing the action.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
